# Build context for packages/designer/Dockerfile (the ttr-viewer image, ttr-core#169). The
# Dockerfile COPYs named paths only; this keeps local build output and dependencies out of them.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/parser/src/generated
packages/grammar/src/generated
packages/kotlin
packages/python
intellij-plugin
docs
docs-site
graphify-out
